@startuml
[*] --> TimeAdjusting
TimeAdjusting -> AdjustingHours : Press Hour Button
TimeAdjusting -> AdjustingMinutes : Press Minute Button
TimeAdjusting -> SettingAlarm : Press Alarm Button
TimeAdjusting -> LightOn : Press Light Button
AdjustingHours -> TimeAdjusting : Increase/Decrease Hours
AdjustingMinutes -> TimeAdjusting : Increase/Decrease Minutes
SettingAlarm -> AlarmOn : Set Alarm Time
AlarmOn --> AlarmOff : Turn Off Alarm
LightOn --> LightOff : Release Light Button
AlarmOff --> [*] : System Shutdown
LightOff --> [*] : System Shutdown
@enduml
